### Pull Request Details API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@githubToken = YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN_HERE
@prId = YOUR_PR_ID_HERE
@repoId = YOUR_REPOSITORY_ID_HERE

###############################################
### SETUP: Login first to get token
###############################################

### 1. Login to get JWT token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

###############################################
### GET PULL REQUEST DETAILS WITH FILES
###############################################

### 2. Get PR Details with Files and Commits (without diff)
# This fetches the PR along with all changed files and commits
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/{{prId}}/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Get PR Details with Files and Full Diff
# includeDiff=true will fetch the complete unified diff (can be large)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/{{prId}}/details?includeDiff=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get PR Details with Explicit GitHub Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/{{prId}}/details?token={{githubToken}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Get PR Details with Diff and GitHub Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/{{prId}}/details?includeDiff=true&token={{githubToken}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

###############################################
### WORKFLOW: First Get PR List, Then Details
###############################################

### 6. Get All PRs for a Repository (to get PR IDs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/repository/{{repoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. Get Specific PR by ID (Basic Info)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/{{prId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Get Full PR Details with Files (Extended Info)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/{{prId}}/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

###############################################
### ERROR CASES
###############################################

### 9. Get Details Without Authentication (Should return 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/{{prId}}/details

###

### 10. Get Details for Non-Existent PR (Should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/invalid-pr-id/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11. Get Details Without GitHub Token (Should fail if not in profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/{{prId}}/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 12. Get Details for PR You Don't Own (Should return 403/400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pull-requests/someone-else-pr-id/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

###############################################
### TESTING WORKFLOW
###############################################

# STEP 1: Setup
#   - Get GitHub Personal Access Token with 'repo' scope
#   - Login and get JWT token (Test #1)
#   - Copy the accessToken

# STEP 2: Get Repository and PR IDs
#   - List repositories: GET /repositories
#   - Copy a repository ID and set as @repoId
#   - Sync PRs: POST /pull-requests/repository/{repoId}/sync
#   - List PRs: GET /pull-requests/repository/{repoId}
#   - Copy a PR ID and set as @prId

# STEP 3: Update Variables
#   - Set @token to your JWT token
#   - Set @githubToken to your GitHub token
#   - Set @prId to a valid PR ID
#   - Set @repoId to a valid repository ID

# STEP 4: Fetch PR Details (Tests #2-5)
#   - Start without diff to see files/commits only
#   - Then try with includeDiff=true for full diff

# STEP 5: Test Error Cases (Tests #9-12)

###

